	(text "EMD low (R1): VCOM is inverted by SPI command, as the firmware does now.\nFit R2 instead of R1 to take VCOM from EIN (LCD_EXTCOMIN) so it keeps toggling in light sleep."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 96.52 0)
		(effects
